{"data":{"attachmentkeynames":["html","css","js"],"cmd":[],"ctl":"worqhm1a15dab50e4m2d2b","db":"dev","desc":"THE 3D flow editor (the Development app mounts it for #/flow/<lib>/<ctlId>/<cmdId>; dev.floweditor3d is now just a delegate to it). Built on the app scene stack: ops are app:scenehost-hosted dev:flownode instances whose click/drag behaviors are the wiring gestures (port tap, wire ghost, keyboard W/arrows/Enter, I-1/I-2 enforced); the FlowDoc stays authoritative and the scene facet is a derived view (flowproject.toSceneDoc). Props {title, graph, source:{lib,ctl,cmd}, onBack}; with no props it runs as the gate harness. Authoring: palette (primitive/command/local/constant/persistent/blank) create + splice, op/terminal/signature inspector, delete op, case chain add/remove, tidy/untangle layout, undo/redo, diagnostics. Save = write_flow_body with base-hash → stale_base → conflict. Run ▸ (or R) hosts one dev:flowtoken per wire in flowdoc.propagationRounds order and, with a source, invokes the real saved command with an args form. Inspector: unsaved changes (diffFlow) and the server journal (diff + revert). api includes dispose, startRun/runLive, addDeck/removeDeck, selectOp/walkOps/frameSelection, serialize, baseHash.","groups":"anonymous","id":"worqhm1a15dab50e4m2d2b","lib":"dev","name":"flowedit3d"},"id":"worqhm1a15dab50e4m2d2b","readers":[],"time":1792711244418,"username":"system","writers":[]}